  "description": "Bull Market Continues!",
  "body_html": "<p>Good Morning and Happy Monday, few brief updates as the stock market opens up this morning. Despite the negative headlines this weekend, the S&amp;P 500 appears to not care about good, or bad news as the markets are largely up. I’ll reiterate: <strong>ignore the news.</strong> On Friday we had a ceasefire, by Sunday the U.S. was striking Iran again. And now Trump is saying the U.S. and Iran will hold “fresh talks.”<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> Trading these headlines is tumultuous and unpredictable. Stay focused on excellent MACRO setups, and abide by trend is friend. </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-has-the-best-vcp-ive-seen?r=4z8lgl\">Top Stocks With Momentum</a></p><ul><li><p>The 2nd place stock, SEZL is up 12%, Blackberry is up 13.5% and the #1 pick  is up 19%. These charts were reviewed on the weekly, so the #1 pick still has runway upwards in my opinion.  Yes, I bought this stock. </p></li></ul></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-284822184?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Playboy Stock Added To The Russell 2000 – Buy?</a></p><ul><li><p>Playboy appears to be a turnaround company and shareholders are gaining value. Institutional volume moved in the last few months. Worth checking out. </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Also, from an administrative point, I will be out Wednesday (7/1) to Friday (7/3) visiting my Dad. I will still swing in if you have any questions for me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/260c97cb-837c-440a-af21-80f98903eb29\">Main Chat</a>, just tag me, and I will respond when I have a moment. Also, the screened stocks will be in <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">Quick Notes</a> instead of the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> page. I don’t plan on lugging my computer for this short trip. </p><p>Overall, we remain in a bull market. Nothing alarming presenting itself besides doomsday articles from the mainstream media. I am mostly focused on adding to our winning stocks, in which I am still incredibly bullish on finance and regional banks specifically. </p><p>See, short and sweet. You all have a great day, and stop by the chat to say hi! </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.cnn.com/2026/06/29/world/live-news/iran-war-strikes-trump</p><p></p></div></div>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
